    "bio": "K.LAW is an  artist from Australia, South West Sydney. Realising his passion and love for music at such a young age, he always had a spark for creativity of his own artistry which he began to take seriously at the age of 17. Songwriting, Producing & Singing are just some of the perks K.LAW uses with his approach to music. Being majorly influenced by a combination of Pop, R&B, Soul from artists such as The Weeknd, Justin Bieber, Chris Brown & Bruno Mars.... all the way through to EDM & Trap. He wishes to push his diverse music approach in his craft.\n\nA proud mix of Filipino & Indigenous heritage, K.LAW started developing his skills through representing both cultures through singing & dancing. Has been performing since a young age and has been apart of some amazing events.\n\nK.LAW is releasing his new hit single \u201cHold on tight\u201d an R&B inspired sound from the likes of Leon Thomas & Craig David! This is the first of of many for 2026 and considers this not even the beginning of his music journey. Hopes for one day for the whole world to see.",
